---
import Context from '../../../layouts/Context.astro';
import { url } from '../../../lib/url';
import ExampleStyles from '../../../components/ExampleStyles.astro';
const sources = [
  { cite: 'Thomas Hemphill, "New Testament Textual Criticism Examples". Adapted and used with permission.', checked: true },
];
---
<Context title="Worked examples" label="Guide" lastChecked="2026-11-20" sources={sources}
  description="Real places where Greek manuscripts differ, worked through step by step for translators.">
  <div class="case">
  <p class="lead">Each example takes one verse where the manuscripts differ: the readings and who supports them, the arguments, what the UBS Greek New Testament prints, and what a translator can do.</p>
  <ul class="cases">
    <li><a class="card" href={url('guide/apparatus/')}>
      <span class="ref">John 1:18</span>
      <span class="q">"Only God" or "only Son"?</span>
      <span class="d">A step-by-step reading of one apparatus entry.</span>
    </a></li>
    <li><a class="card" href={url('guide/examples/james-2-20/')}>
      <span class="ref">James 2:20</span>
      <span class="q">Is faith without works "useless" or "dead"?</span>
      <span class="d">Early witnesses split, and the context decides.</span>
    </a></li>
    <li><a class="card" href={url('guide/examples/john-7-53/')}>
      <span class="ref">John 7:53–8:11</span>
      <span class="q">The woman caught in adultery</span>
      <span class="d">A whole story some manuscripts lack, worked through step by step.</span>
    </a></li>
    <li><a class="card" href={url('guide/examples/romans-16-7/')}>
      <span class="ref">Romans 16:7</span>
      <span class="q">Junia or Junias?</span>
      <span class="d">The letters are certain; the accent, and so the gender, is debated.</span>
    </a></li>
  </ul>
  <p>The James and Romans examples are adapted from material by Thomas Hemphill, used with permission.</p>
  </div>
  <ExampleStyles />
</Context>
<style>
  .cases { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 1.25rem 0; display: grid; gap: 1rem; }
  @media (min-width: 40rem) { .cases { grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(14rem, 1fr)); } }
  .card {
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: .35rem; height: 100%; box-sizing: border-box;
    padding: 1rem 1.1rem; border: 1px solid var(--rule); border-left: 4px solid var(--rubric);
    border-radius: 10px; background: var(--paper-2); color: var(--ink); text-decoration: none;
    transition: border-color 160ms ease;
  }
  .card:hover, .card:focus-visible { border-color: var(--rubric); }
  .ref { font-family: var(--sans); font-size: var(--step--1); letter-spacing: .08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--rubric); }
  .q { font-family: var(--serif); font-size: var(--step-1); line-height: 1.3; }
  .d { font-size: var(--step--1); color: var(--ink-2); }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .card { transition: none; } }
</style>
